    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the water is just making it feel more stinging and weird. honestly i dont think i can get to a doctor right now, it's late and im alone. the herbal drops in my cabinet are just chamomile and aloe, would those be safe to put in right now to soothe the burn instead of just sitting here with water running in it? it feels like it's getting worse so i need something to stop the pain.",
